            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Feel like the world's best drone pilot.<br></li><li> People say they love the steering.<br></li><li> 25 challenges with increasing difficulty.<br></li><li> Local pass-and-play multiplayer, great for parties.<br></li><li> Designed for VR but can also be played on a regular screen with keyboard or gamepad.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATED WITH LOVE BY NEUSTON</h2>Neuston is a game studio that focuses on creating super-tight action games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEIZURE WARNING</h2>A small percentage of people may experience a seizure when exposed to certain visual images, including flashing lights or patterns. Immediately stop playing and consult a doctor if you experience any symptoms.",
