                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is way better than it needs to be. Simple fun controls, nice atmosphere, and well tuned challenges. There's a few dozen levels, in each you are trying to touch checkpoints as quickly as possible while dodging lasers and missiles. The faster you reach check points the higher star ranking.\n\nEDIT: Previously I mentioned performance problems, but this has been resolved in the latest update! The game now plays much smoother which makes everything look better and it's easier to make split second corrections.\n\nI'm now stuck at the second to last level, but I'm playing almost every day and keep improving at it.",
